            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumwaka wamusanu aibili, Jehoyada wakatumina basilutwe baba-Kari ababalindizi, wabanjizya mulinguwe muŋanda ya-Jehova, watangana abo cizuminano, wabakonkezya muŋanda ya-Jehova, akubatondezya mwana wamwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.9.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mak 9:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakabalailila kuti, Mbuboobu mbumweelede kucita. Akati kankamu zyanu zyotatwe, inkamu yabaabo banjila buzuba bwa-Sabata kukulanga iŋanda yamwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(inkamu imwi niicili kumulyango wa-Suri, aimwi yatatu niicili kusule lyamulyango wabalindizi), baleelede kulanga iŋanda yabwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ankamu zimwi zyobile zyabaabo basika buzuba bwa-Sabata kukulanga iŋanda ya-Jehova balange mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleelede kumuzyunguluka mwami, umwi aumwi uli azilwisyo zyakwe mujanza lyakwe, nkabela kufumbwa muntu uuswenenena kumilongo uleelede kujayigwa, Amube amwami ciindi cakuzwa aciindi cakunjila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
