        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakagwisya mwana wamwami, wamubikila munsini, wamupa ibbuku lyamulongo wa-Leza, aboobo bakamupa bwami, bamunanika, bakamba, akwaamba kuti, Aongole mwami.",
          "type": "text",
