        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakalanga, wakabona mwami uliimvwi kumbali lyacilende, mbubonya mbuli ciyanza mbucibede, abasilutwe abasimyeembo baliimvwi kumbali lyamwami, abantu boonse bacisi balatangala akulizya myeembo. Mpawo Ataliya wakazapaula zyakusama zyakwe, wakwiila kuti, Ndaabwa! Ndaabwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
