        {
          "text": "Mpawo bantu boonse banyika bakainka kuŋanda ya-Baala akwiimwaya. Zipaililo zyakwe azikozyano zyoonse bakazivwinyauna, alakwe Matani mupaizi wa-Baala bakamujaya mpoonya awo anembo lyacipaililo, Alimwi mupaizi wakabika bantu kuti balindile iŋanda ya-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
