              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakatolelela basilutwe aba-Kari abalindizi abantu boonse banyika, nkabela bakagwisya mwami kuŋanda ya-Jehova, bainda kunzila yamulyango wabalindizi, akumusisya kuŋanda yabwami, aboobo wakakala acuuno cabwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
